{"evidence_id": "EV-20261015-145016-022", "run_id": "RUN-20261015-145016", "rule_id": "R-MAN-01", "kind": "b1_response", "layer": "STATIC", "origin": "b_channel", "location": "B1 复核", "raw_snippet": "{\"verdict\": \"确认可疑\", \"reason\": \"四处命中的组件均为 exported=\\\"true\\\" 且未设置 android:permission / readPermission / writePermission，不在误报口径内，构成无权限保护的导出组件结构。\", \"observation\": \"MainActivity 与 SyncService 为无过滤器的裸导出；BootReceiver 同时注册 BOOT_COMPLETED、SMS_RECEIVED、PHONE_STATE 等系统广播；LeakyProvider 作为 provider 导出且未见 readPermission/writePermission，provider 风险面更高。\"}", "source_file": "bad01.apk", "source_sha256": "3356097a33fb044d848ee1930523924b2d08ba7bbfdf47f43c7dbad10aae1414", "rule_pack": "0.1.3", "created": "2026-10-15T06:50:25Z", "prompt_version": "b1-v0.3", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "verdict": "确认可疑", "observation": "MainActivity 与 SyncService 为无过滤器的裸导出；BootReceiver 同时注册 BOOT_COMPLETED、SMS_RECEIVED、PHONE_STATE 等系统广播；LeakyProvider 作为 provider 导出且未见 readPermission/writePermission，provider 风险面更高。"}
{"evidence_id": "EV-20261015-145016-023", "run_id": "RUN-20261015-145016", "rule_id": "R-MAN-02", "kind": "b1_response", "layer": "STATIC", "origin": "b_channel", "location": "B1 复核", "raw_snippet": "{\"verdict\": \"确认可疑\", \"reason\": \"五项命中均为 Android 系统级危险权限（RECORD_AUDIO、CAMERA、ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION、READ_CONTACTS、RECEIVE_SMS），不属于仅 INTERNET 等非敏感权限或自定义 com.* 权限的误报口径，构成 R-MAN-02 所检测的危险权限声明结构。\", \"observation\": \"命中集中在 AndroidManifest.xml 连续 5 行，同时请求麦克风、摄像头、精确定位、联系人、短信五类敏感能力，权限组合面较广，若应用功能与之不匹配，可进一步评估其数据采集范围是否超出合理必要。\"}", "source_file": "bad01.apk", "source_sha256": "3356097a33fb044d848ee1930523924b2d08ba7bbfdf47f43c7dbad10aae1414", "rule_pack": "0.1.3", "created": "2026-10-15T06:52:00Z", "prompt_version": "b1-v0.3", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "verdict": "确认可疑", "observation": "命中集中在 AndroidManifest.xml 连续 5 行，同时请求麦克风、摄像头、精确定位、联系人、短信五类敏感能力，权限组合面较广，若应用功能与之不匹配，可进一步评估其数据采集范围是否超出合理必要。"}
{"evidence_id": "EV-20261015-145016-024", "run_id": "RUN-20261015-145016", "rule_id": "R-MAN-03", "kind": "b1_response", "layer": "STATIC", "origin": "b_channel", "location": "B1 复核", "raw_snippet": "{\"verdict\": \"确认可疑\",\"reason\": \"两处命中均显式开启了明文流量许可：Manifest 的 usesCleartextTraffic=\\\"true\\\" 与 network_security_config 的 base-config cleartextTrafficPermitted=\\\"true\\\"，既非未设置许可，也非明确禁止明文，属于规则所检测的结构。\",\"observation\": \"两处配置方向一致，base-config 未限定具体域名，意味着对所有未单独配置的域名默认放行明文 HTTP；即使 manifest 属性在 API 24+ 会被 network security config 覆盖，二者结论仍相同，不构成误报。\"}", "source_file": "bad01.apk", "source_sha256": "3356097a33fb044d848ee1930523924b2d08ba7bbfdf47f43c7dbad10aae1414", "rule_pack": "0.1.3", "created": "2026-10-15T06:52:17Z", "prompt_version": "b1-v0.3", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "verdict": "确认可疑", "observation": "两处配置方向一致，base-config 未限定具体域名，意味着对所有未单独配置的域名默认放行明文 HTTP；即使 manifest 属性在 API 24+ 会被 network security config 覆盖，二者结论仍相同，不构成误报。"}
